{
  "description": "MR base: dense 10-agent matching-engine trace (Noise+Value+MarketMaker+Momentum) with marketable order flow producing frequent fills, partial fills, and cancel/replace churn; snapshot_interval_ns sets a 1s checkpoint cadence. Designed so checkpoint/resume and audit-trail reconstruction have rich full ABIDES state (book + agent state + event queue) to reproduce under Tier-A replay.",
